# Menu & navigation

## Layers

1. **Scenes** (Menu / Game / PostBattle) — only via `RootEvents` → HFSM
2. **Full-screen windows** — `WindowStackManager` when menu grows (not required yet)
3. **Dialogs/overlays** — NOT on the window stack

## Current app

- Menu: play CTA → `root_events.ev_start_game.emit({})`
- PostBattle: again → `ev_start_game`; menu → `ev_return_to_menu`
- AppRoot bridges Resource signals to HFSM dotted events

## When adding menu windows

- One `WindowStackManager` under Menu UI
- Forward: `ButtonWindowTransition`; Back: `ButtonWindowBack` / `ui_cancel` (**pop**, don't re-open Main)
- Optional hooks: `on_window_enter()` / `on_window_exit()`
- Confirm/pause overlays stay **off** the stack

## Placement

- Menu scene → `src/game/scenes/menu/`
- Results → `src/game/scenes/post_battle/`
- Shared account/progress (when added) → `src/game/account/` wired in `app_root/`
- Stack helpers → `core/lib/window_stack_manager/`

## Avoid

- Second navigation router beside HFSM + (future) `WindowStackManager`
- Loading `Game` scene from menu scripts directly
- Putting confirm dialogs on the full-screen stack
- Building whole window UI trees in GDScript when a `.tscn` works
